by name, default setting: the tree of the default setting
by name: the tree of the other setting
by name, in one tree: only in the tree of the other setting
by name, -nostdlib: File not found: which.cmxs
by name, in the current directory: the current directory
by name, -nocwd: File not found: here.cmxs
by path, -nocwd: the current directory
by name, in +camlp4: the directory for camlp4
by name, in +camlp4, -nostdlib: File not found: extension.cmxs
